  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENHANCING OPPORTUNITIES FOR HEARING-IMPAIRED CHILDREN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of the project is to promote inclusive education through increased access and participation of special needs, in particular the hearing impaired children in formal and vocational skills training and the provision of audiological support. It addresses an urgent and important need of inclusive education in the country and will contribute to a better integration of hearing impaired children into society. Key activities for this project are namely; procurement and upgrade of the carpentry workshop, rehabilitation of Audiology Unit, training of Audiology department staff, capacity building and training of carpentry staff</narrative>
  </description>
